Error [E0209]: Implicit clone of `msg`
  --> implicit_clone_uses_move_menu_when_dead_in_all_enclosing_blocks.jet:11:17
    |
 11 |         consume(msg)
    |                 ^^^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^msg`) to move it — this is `msg`'s last use — or the copy marker `~` (`~msg`) to keep a copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209
